WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.225
Zann flinched as he heard the splash of Venna hitting the water.

2
00:00:04.226 --> 00:00:10.383
But he didn't dare move, not even to look over the edge of the cliff. Morb was still nearby.

3
00:00:10.384 --> 00:00:16.503
"Good riddance," Morb muttered. He snapped his fingers and zapped out of sight.

4
00:00:16.504 --> 00:00:21.972
"Come on." Perda rushed to the edge. "Maybe there's time to save Venna!"

5
00:00:21.973 --> 00:00:25.145
Zann ran over and looked down at the dark water.

6
00:00:25.146 --> 00:00:28.888
Then he noticed Wyssa rubbing her fingers together.

7
00:00:28.889 --> 00:00:32.254
He guessed she was about to zap away to find Morb.

8
00:00:32.255 --> 00:00:38.744
"Wait!" He ran to her and grabbed her arm. "Please. You have to help Venna."

9
00:00:38.745 --> 00:00:45.964
"You help her if you like," Wyssa said harshly. "I have more pressing business."

10
00:00:45.965 --> 00:00:49.487
"But she was Morb's prisoner, right?" Darb put in.

11
00:00:49.488 --> 00:00:52.312
"Maybe she can tell us more about his plans."

12
00:00:52.313 --> 00:00:57.692
Now Wyssa looked much more interested. "Hmm," she said.

13
00:00:57.693 --> 00:01:00.895
Suddenly everyone heard a splash from below.

14
00:01:00.896 --> 00:01:06.512
Venna had popped to the surface of the water. She was slimy and breathless.

15
00:01:06.513 --> 00:01:10.571
"Help!" she cried as she desperately treaded water.

16
00:01:10.572 --> 00:01:13.618
"Hold on!" Perda called down to Venna.

17
00:01:13.619 --> 00:01:18.863
She turned to Wyssa. "Hurry—before the gulper changes its mind."

18
00:01:18.864 --> 00:01:26.484
Wyssa waved a hand. Venna levitated out of the gorge and landed beside the group, shaking and coughing.

19
00:01:26.485 --> 00:01:30.327
"How did she escape from the gulper?" Gliss asked.

20
00:01:30.328 --> 00:01:33.838
"Venna must still be under the Dousing spell," said Darb.

21
00:01:33.839 --> 00:01:38.227
"Maybe the gulper spit her out when it realized she didn't have any magic."

22
00:01:38.228 --> 00:01:43.155
"Are you under a Dousing spell, Venna?" Wyssa waved her hand again.

23
00:01:43.156 --> 00:01:47.027
A buzz of magic energy surrounded Venna for a moment.

24
00:01:47.028 --> 00:01:51.863
"Oh!" said Venna. "Did you . . . ?" She rubbed her hands together.

25
00:01:51.864 --> 00:01:56.921
Instantly her clothes and hair were dry. "Thank you!" she cried.

26
00:01:56.922 --> 00:02:00.711
"It feels so good to have magic again."

27
00:02:00.712 --> 00:02:06.195
"I can't believe you're here!" Perda said. "How did you end up with Morb?"

28
00:02:06.196 --> 00:02:12.036
Venna shuddered. "Morb," she spat, already seeming more like her old self.

29
00:02:12.037 --> 00:02:16.548
"Where did he go? We must stop his evil plans!"

30
00:02:16.549 --> 00:02:20.362
Zann stepped forward. "Do you know if he found my parents?

31
00:02:20.363 --> 00:02:23.019
We heard he was looking for them."

32
00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:30.141
"Nax and Asta?" Venna looked surprised. "No, as far as I know I was his only Magician prisoner.

33
00:02:30.142 --> 00:02:33.693
Besides, I thought your parents disappeared years ago."

34
00:02:33.694 --> 00:02:39.046
Zann's shoulders slumped. Had he reached another dead end in the search for his parents?

35
00:02:39.047 --> 00:02:46.806
Wyssa leaned toward Venna. "You mentioned Morb's plans—did he tell you what he's trying to do?"

36
00:02:46.807 --> 00:02:53.334
Venna nodded. "For the past couple of days, Morb has been searching for the Horn of the Otherworld."

37
00:02:53.335 --> 00:02:56.440
"Huh?" Zann traded a look with his friends.

38
00:02:56.441 --> 00:03:03.216
The Horn of the Otherworld was the relic Teplo had been holding right before the Cave of the Unknown collapsed.

39
00:03:03.217 --> 00:03:09.901
"The Horn of the Otherworld?" Gliss frowned. "Why does Morb want that?"

40
00:03:09.902 --> 00:03:16.947
Venna shrugged. "He wouldn't tell me. All I know is that the Horn wasn't where he expected to find it.

41
00:03:16.948 --> 00:03:22.349
So he traced its magical essence, which led him to me."

42
00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:26.645
"You?" Wyssa raised an eyebrow. "Why?"

43
00:03:26.646 --> 00:03:30.054
"Because I'd touched it recently." Venna grimaced.

44
00:03:30.055 --> 00:03:39.497
"And because I was in a Doused state—that made it much easier for Morb to control me than someone like Tok or Teplo."

45
00:03:39.498 --> 00:03:44.013
"I see," Zann said. "So Morb found you in the vortex?"

46
00:03:44.014 --> 00:03:48.440
"Yes. I suppose I should be grateful." Venna grimaced again.

47
00:03:48.441 --> 00:03:54.699
"If Morb hadn't grabbed me, I wouldn't have survived the vortex much longer without magic."

48
00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:59.635
"I bet Morb wants to try to take over Magica again," Perda said.

49
00:03:59.636 --> 00:04:03.959
"Maybe with another crazy contraption from the Old Times."

50
00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:07.457
"I'm sure you're right." Venna sounded worried.

51
00:04:07.458 --> 00:04:13.577
"I only wish I had access to the ancient texts so I could try to figure out what he has in mind."

52
00:04:13.578 --> 00:04:18.884
"Did Morb feed you to the gulper because you wouldn't tell him where the Horn is?" Darb asked.

53
00:04:18.885 --> 00:04:22.861
"Not exactly. I did resist for some time.

54
00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:26.717
But Morb finally got impatient." Venna shuddered.

55
00:04:26.718 --> 00:04:30.570
"He forced me to tell by using a Possession spell."

56
00:04:30.571 --> 00:04:34.935
"That spell uses a lot of energy," Wyssa said.

57
00:04:34.936 --> 00:04:40.667
"I know," Venna said. "I suppose that's why he didn't use it as soon as he grabbed me."

58
00:04:40.668 --> 00:04:48.916
She rubbed her chin thoughtfully. "If we could find Morb now, he might be in a weakened state."

59
00:04:48.917 --> 00:04:52.415
"It could be our best chance," Wyssa agreed.

60
00:04:52.416 --> 00:04:57.041
"Where is the relic? We must reach it before he does."

61
00:04:57.042 --> 00:05:03.100
Venna opened her mouth to answer. But at that moment, Perda let out a sharp cry.

62
00:05:03.101 --> 00:05:06.519
Then she crumpled to the ground, unconscious.

63
00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:10.143
"Perda!" Zann exclaimed, kneeling by her side.

64
00:05:10.144 --> 00:05:13.364
"What's wrong with her?" Gliss sounded scared.

65
00:05:13.365 --> 00:05:16.966
"Let me through." Wyssa pushed past the kids.

66
00:05:16.967 --> 00:05:23.921
She touched Perda's face and then murmured a few words. "Awaken," she added, snapping her fingers.

67
00:05:23.922 --> 00:05:30.167
Perda blinked and sat up. "Whoa," she mumbled. "That was weird!"

68
00:05:30.168 --> 00:05:32.436
"What happened?" Zann asked.

69
00:05:32.437 --> 00:05:35.712
Perda stared at him. "I saw them," she said.

70
00:05:35.713 --> 00:05:41.645
"Your parents. I recognized them from the hologram we saw in the Cave."

71
00:05:41.646 --> 00:05:46.722
"What?" Zann exclaimed. "What do you mean, you saw my parents?"

72
00:05:46.723 --> 00:05:53.284
Perda shrugged. "It was a super strong vision—like a really vivid dream."

73
00:05:53.285 --> 00:05:58.525
"But what caused it?" Gliss wondered. "None of the rest of us saw anything."

74
00:05:58.526 --> 00:06:02.255
"I don't know." Then Perda's eyes widened.

75
00:06:02.256 --> 00:06:09.103
"Wait, yes I do! I put my hand in my pocket and touched Zann's message stone.

76
00:06:09.104 --> 00:06:15.710
See?" She pointed. "It fell there, on the ground. It must have caused the vision!"

77
00:06:15.711 --> 00:06:23.540
"Let me try!" Zann grabbed the stone and was almost knocked off his feet by a strong vision of his parents.

78
00:06:23.541 --> 00:06:26.867
He could see them more clearly than ever before.

79
00:06:26.868 --> 00:06:29.731
They were standing in a dimly lit room.

80
00:06:29.732 --> 00:06:38.637
A tiny Roodian woman was with them. All three of them looked terrified!

